  "title": "White Mountains Announces Final Results of Its Tender Offer",
  "summary": "HAMILTON, Bermuda , Dec. 24, 2025 /PRNewswire/ -- White Mountains Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: WTM) announced today the final results of its \"modified Dutch auction\" tender offer. The tender offer expired at 12:00 midnight, New York City time, at the end of the day on December 19, 2025 .",
